+# 📢 Openings
+
+**We are hiring!** Our team at I2R, A\*STAR is looking for **multiple master internship students**. We work on cutting-edge technologies for truly efficient, secure and practical large AI systems, including LLMs/VLMs and more.
+
+- **Requirements:** solid project or research experience in deep learning, a strong problem-solving mindset and good development skills. Candidates should be currently matriculated in Singapore.
+- **We offer:** internship compensation, a state-of-the-art R&D platform, and opportunities for referral. Team members come from Stanford, PKU, BJTU, NUS and NTU, with publications in top venues (CVPR, ICCV, ECCV, NeurIPS, ACL, TPAMI, TIP, TNNLS, etc.).
+
+Interested candidates are welcome to send their CVs to [Xu_Kaixin@a-star.edu.sg](mailto:Xu_Kaixin@a-star.edu.sg).
